column name: potential usage  
• LANGUAGES."repo_name": join‐key to link repositories with their commits  
• LANGUAGES."language": detect repositories whose primary language is JavaScript  
• SAMPLE_COMMITS."repo_name": group & count rows (= commits) per repository  
• SAMPLE_COMMITS."commit": a unique id for each commit; COUNT(*) on this table gives commit totals per repo  

Typical filter/condition  
• LANGUAGES."language"::STRING ILIKE '%JavaScript%' — isolates JavaScript repositories  

Below are 10 exploratory → goal‑oriented Snowflake SQL queries (each limited to 20 rows, all identifiers double‑quoted).

```sql
--Description: 1) Peek at a few language records to understand data shape
SELECT *
FROM "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."LANGUAGES"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 2) View the distinct language strings stored in the LANGUAGES table
SELECT DISTINCT "language"::STRING AS "language_text"
FROM "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."LANGUAGES"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 3) Show repositories whose language field mentions “JavaScript”
SELECT "repo_name"
FROM "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."LANGUAGES"
WHERE "language"::STRING ILIKE '%JavaScript%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 4) Inspect raw commit rows for one repository (replace name as needed)
SELECT *
FROM "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."SAMPLE_COMMITS"
WHERE "repo_name" = 'jquery/jquery'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 5) Count total commits for every repository in SAMPLE_COMMITS
SELECT "repo_name",
       COUNT(*) AS "commit_cnt"
FROM "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."SAMPLE_COMMITS"
GROUP BY "repo_name"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 6) Join language info to commit counts (no filter yet)
SELECT sc."repo_name",
       COUNT(*) AS "commit_cnt",
       lg."language"::STRING AS "lang"
FROM "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."SAMPLE_COMMITS" sc
JOIN "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."LANGUAGES"  lg
  ON sc."repo_name" = lg."repo_name"
GROUP BY sc."repo_name", lg."language"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 7) Restrict to repositories tagged as JavaScript
SELECT sc."repo_name",
       COUNT(*) AS "commit_cnt"
FROM "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."SAMPLE_COMMITS" sc
JOIN "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."LANGUAGES" lg
  ON sc."repo_name" = lg."repo_name"
WHERE lg."language"::STRING ILIKE '%JavaScript%'
GROUP BY sc."repo_name"
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 8) Order JavaScript repositories by commit count, largest first
SELECT sc."repo_name",
       COUNT(*) AS "commit_cnt"
FROM "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."SAMPLE_COMMITS" sc
JOIN "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."LANGUAGES" lg
  ON sc."repo_name" = lg."repo_name"
WHERE lg."language"::STRING ILIKE '%JavaScript%'
GROUP BY sc."repo_name"
ORDER BY "commit_cnt" DESC
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Description: 9) Pull the very top two JavaScript repositories by commit count
SELECT sc."repo_name",
       COUNT(*) AS "commit_cnt"
FROM "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."SAMPLE_COMMITS" sc
JOIN "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."LANGUAGES" lg
  ON sc."repo_name" = lg."repo_name"
WHERE lg."language"::STRING ILIKE '%JavaScript%'
GROUP BY sc."repo_name"
ORDER BY "commit_cnt" DESC
LIMIT 2;
```

```sql
--Description: 10) Same as #9 but with an explicit CTE structure for readability
WITH js_repos AS (
    SELECT "repo_name"
    FROM "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."LANGUAGES"
    WHERE "language"::STRING ILIKE '%JavaScript%'
)
SELECT sc."repo_name",
       COUNT(*) AS "commit_cnt"
FROM "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."SAMPLE_COMMITS" sc
JOIN js_repos jr
  ON sc."repo_name" = jr."repo_name"
GROUP BY sc."repo_name"
ORDER BY "commit_cnt" DESC
LIMIT 2;
```
